3005:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
3006:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
3007:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
